{"4225360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "RGB: EXECUTION", "steam_appid": 4225360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4945160, 4942820], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>On September 9, 2012, an <strong>Altair</strong> unit is manually reactivated by an unknown entity. 7,305 days have passed since its last record. The state of the world is unknown. Your task remains unchanged: <strong>return to the ocean, and kill Vega</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4225360/extras/af42792872e944f506dc2234715af1f9.poster.avif?t=1787876284\" width=580 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4225360/extras/af42792872e944f506dc2234715af1f9.webm?t=1787876284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4225360/extras/af42792872e944f506dc2234715af1f9.mp4?t=1787876284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RGB: Execution</strong> is a 2D pixel action game focused mostly on boss encounters, a <strong>tactical boss-rush</strong>. Heavily narrative-driven, inspired by “unique bosses” experiences such as <i>Shadow of the Colossus</i>. Each boss is a self-contained challenge, demanding a different commitment from the player—both mechanically and mentally—to uncover how it can be defeated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4225360/extras/cb3ddba53ede6f6957f1f39d0efeb65f.poster.avif?t=1787876284\" width=540 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4225360/extras/cb3ddba53ede6f6957f1f39d0efeb65f.webm?t=1787876284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4225360/extras/cb3ddba53ede6f6957f1f39d0efeb65f.mp4?t=1787876284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4225360/extras/3b626c5668746d1bdbb6370a6b9244ce.poster.avif?t=1787876284\" width=540 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4225360/extras/3b626c5668746d1bdbb6370a6b9244ce.webm?t=1787876284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4225360/extras/3b626c5668746d1bdbb6370a6b9244ce.mp4?t=1787876284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter blends action and problem-solving. Observation, timing, and experimentation are just as important as precision and reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4225360/extras/33d880e75eb04c241a0997dcd807cacd.poster.avif?t=1787876284\" width=540 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4225360/extras/33d880e75eb04c241a0997dcd807cacd.webm?t=1787876284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4225360/extras/33d880e75eb04c241a0997dcd807cacd.mp4?t=1787876284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4225360/extras/dd3653d76b422cac378b55b492f39f70.poster.avif?t=1787876284\" width=540 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4225360/extras/dd3653d76b422cac378b55b492f39f70.webm?t=1787876284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4225360/extras/dd3653d76b422cac378b55b492f39f70.mp4?t=1787876284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <i>a dead world</i> where the only remaining trace of civilization is <i>the internet</i> still active; complete your mission to return to the ocean, <i>and finish what you started</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Slash, parry, dash—and <i>think</i>.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4225360/extras/a12bb891f4cbacc7998de9af8621c02a.poster.avif?t=1787876284\" width=540 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4225360/extras/a12bb891f4cbacc7998de9af8621c02a.webm?t=1787876284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4225360/extras/a12bb891f4cbacc7998de9af8621c02a.mp4?t=1787876284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4225360/extras/b3f8e3574e5548d4ce80a69a3e1d372c.poster.avif?t=1787876284\" width=540 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4225360/extras/b3f8e3574e5548d4ce80a69a3e1d372c.webm?t=1787876284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4225360/extras/b3f8e3574e5548d4ce80a69a3e1d372c.mp4?t=1787876284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot; <strong>Fiction and the internet—two faces of the same coin.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Does a fictional persona represent a reflection of the self, or merely a façade?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>What do you want it to be, Altair? &quot;</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>On September 9, 2012, an <strong>Altair</strong> unit is manually reactivated by an unknown entity. 7,305 days have passed since its last record. The state of the world is unknown. Your task remains unchanged: <strong>return to the ocean, and kill Vega</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4225360/extras/af42792872e944f506dc2234715af1f9.poster.avif?t=1787876284\" width=580 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4225360/extras/af42792872e944f506dc2234715af1f9.webm?t=1787876284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4225360/extras/af42792872e944f506dc2234715af1f9.mp4?t=1787876284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RGB: Execution</strong> is a 2D pixel action game focused mostly on boss encounters, a <strong>tactical boss-rush</strong>. Heavily narrative-driven, inspired by “unique bosses” experiences such as <i>Shadow of the Colossus</i>. Each boss is a self-contained challenge, demanding a different commitment from the player—both mechanically and mentally—to uncover how it can be defeated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4225360/extras/cb3ddba53ede6f6957f1f39d0efeb65f.poster.avif?t=1787876284\" width=540 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4225360/extras/cb3ddba53ede6f6957f1f39d0efeb65f.webm?t=1787876284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4225360/extras/cb3ddba53ede6f6957f1f39d0efeb65f.mp4?t=1787876284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4225360/extras/3b626c5668746d1bdbb6370a6b9244ce.poster.avif?t=1787876284\" width=540 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4225360/extras/3b626c5668746d1bdbb6370a6b9244ce.webm?t=1787876284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4225360/extras/3b626c5668746d1bdbb6370a6b9244ce.mp4?t=1787876284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter blends action and problem-solving. Observation, timing, and experimentation are just as important as precision and reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4225360/extras/33d880e75eb04c241a0997dcd807cacd.poster.avif?t=1787876284\" width=540 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4225360/extras/33d880e75eb04c241a0997dcd807cacd.webm?t=1787876284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4225360/extras/33d880e75eb04c241a0997dcd807cacd.mp4?t=1787876284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" a